WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.010
A cannon fires a heavy ball forwards.

2
00:00:03.060 --> 00:00:06.550
At the same instant, the heavy
cannon lurches backwards across

3
00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.190
the deck, its wheels rattling.

4
00:00:09.240 --> 00:00:12.950
Nothing struck it from behind,
and nobody gave it a shove.

5
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:16.010
So why does the cannon
move backwards at all?

6
00:00:16.060 --> 00:00:18.410
In this mission, you'll meet momentum,

7
00:00:18.460 --> 00:00:21.930
the quantity you get by
multiplying mass by velocity,

8
00:00:21.980 --> 00:00:23.990
and see why its direction matters.

9
00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:27.530
You'll find out what happens to
the total momentum when objects

10
00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.510
push apart or crash together.

11
00:00:29.560 --> 00:00:34.180
Your mission: find out why
the cannon rolls backwards.
